WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
You began as a single cell: a zygote.

2
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:08.500
It divided again and again,
making cells with identical genes.

3
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.180
Now you have hundreds of cell types.

4
00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:14.650
A nerve cell and a muscle
cell look nothing alike.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.620
Yet both still carry the same genes.

6
00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:21.830
So if the genes are the same,
why are the cells so different?

7
00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:26.650
In this mission, you'll follow one
cell as it becomes many kinds of cell.

8
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:31.020
Then you'll test your explanation
on cells you have never met before.

9
00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:36.360
Your mission: explain why cells that
carry the same genes can be so different.
